---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Download"
  description="Lumen does not have a signed app release yet."
  lang="en"
  altHref="/download/"
>
  <h1>Download</h1>

  <div class="notice">
    There is no signed APK to download yet. The <a
      href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-app">lumen-app</a
    > application has not been built yet. A release will be available here once the minimum viable
    product (MVP) milestone is reached.
  </div>

  <p>
    In the meantime you can follow the project's development directly on
    <a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive">GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
